    "content" : "TURF ARENA - RULES & POLICIES\n\n1. CANCELATION POLICY:\n   - Cancellations made 24 hours prior to the slot receive a 100% full refund.\n   - Cancellations within 24 hours receive a 50% refund.\n   - No-shows receive zero refund.\n\n2. FOOTWEAR & EQUIPMENT:\n   - Only molded rubber studs or flat-soled turf shoes are allowed on the pitch.\n   - Metal studs are strictly forbidden to protect the turf surface.\n\n3. AMENITIES & PARKING:\n   - Free parking is available for up to 30 cars and 50 two-wheelers.\n   - Changing rooms, drinking water, and floodlights are included in the hourly rate.",
